@startuml HeroSingletonPattern

!theme plain
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontStyle bold

title 英雄机单例模式

abstract class AbstractAircraft {
    # int maxHp
    # int hp
    
    + AbstractAircraft(int, int, int, int, int)
    + void decreaseHp(int)
    + int getHp()
    + {abstract} List<BaseBullet> shoot()
}

class HeroAircraft {
    - int shootNum
    - int power
    - int direction
    - {static} volatile HeroAircraft Instance
    
    - HeroAircraft(int, int, int, int, int)
    + {static} HeroAircraft getInstance(int, int, int, int, int)
    + void forward()
    + List<BaseBullet> shoot()
    + void addHp(int)
}

abstract class BaseBullet {
    - int power
    
    + BaseBullet(int, int, int, int, int)
    + void forward()
    + int getPower()
}

class HeroBullet {
    + HeroBullet(int, int, int, int, int)
}

AbstractAircraft <|-- HeroAircraft
BaseBullet <|-- HeroBullet
HeroAircraft ..> HeroBullet : creates

note right of HeroAircraft : 单例模式\n- 私有构造函数\n- 静态实例变量\n- 双重检查锁定\n- 全局唯一实例

@enduml
